{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/paradise-hills-gulf-land-golf-city","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":605,"crm_id":"627","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Paradise Hills","slug":"paradise-hills-gulf-land-golf-city","display_address":"Golf City","building_type":["villa"],"completion_year":"Ready ","developer":"Gulf Land Property Developers","price":7950000,"display_price":"","lattitude":25.0159285,"longitude":55.2290344,"min_bedrooms":3,"max_bedrooms":6,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Paradise Hills is the epitome of luxury and modern lifestyle in the heart of Dubai. Consisting of 170 villas with <strong>5-6 bedrooms</strong> and townhouses with <strong>3-4 bedrooms</strong>, the complex offers luxurious accommodation combined with unique amenities.</p><p>Each villa and townhouse in Paradise Hills is distinguished by modern style and elegance. They are equipped with private pools, landscaped areas and spacious staff rooms, providing the perfect combination of comfort and prestige. The interiors are inspired by advanced design solutions.</p><p>The unique Paradise Hills Park offers residents a quiet atmosphere and a beautiful landscape. This private \"paradise\" is also home to many species of birds, giving the place even more charm.</p><p>The complex provides a wide range of amenities: from medical centers and nurseries to shops, cafes and playgrounds. It has everything you need for a comfortable pastime and socialization with family and friends.</p><p>Located in the Dubiland area, Paradise Hills is conveniently located close to major thoroughfares, providing ease of movement around the city. It is also close to famous attractions such as Palm Jumeirah and Downtown Dubai. Paradise Hills is the perfect place to stay in Dubai, where every day turns into a real celebration of life.</p>","tile_image